// Ameublement (module « Meubles & literie »): made-to-measure and showroom orders, foam cut to size and mattresses, repairs and re-upholstery,
// delivery and assembly, deposits and instalment plans, workshop costs, packs, appointments and after-sales (warranty, claims).
